Kurtuluş Gemici"}]]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"academic-date","children":"2021.09 — 2024.06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"山东大学 · 人类学本科"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"哲学与社会发展学院 · 人类学系"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"academic-advisor","children":"本科导师：文玉杓（Okpyo Moon）"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"接受人类学理论、民族志写作、饮食与生态人类学训练。"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"academic-earlier","children":"此前于 2020—2021 年在山东大学学习朝英双语，随后进入人类学专业。"}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"reading-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"研究与教学经历 · 选录"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"cooperation-list","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["科技与社会课程助教 ",["$","span",null,{"className":"experience-date","children":"2025"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"参与 SOC350: Technology and Society 与 SSB1002: History and Sociology of Technological Change 的教学支持。"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["韩国仁川中华街田野 ",["$","span",null,{"className":"experience-date","children":"2024"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"围绕青年教育开展访谈与田野记录，整理当地华文学校的口述史，撰写研究报告的教育部分。"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["基层医疗与乡村教师口述史 ",["$","span",null,{"className":"experience-date","children":"2021—2023"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"参与乡村教师生命史访谈，以及基层医生职业经验与医疗实践的口述史研究，积累访谈、材料整理与研究协调经验。"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"reading-section","id":"publications","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"论文与会议报告"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"scholarly-work","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"note-tag","children":"JOURNAL ARTICLE · 2023"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12889-022-14917-9","children":"Relationships between physical activity, body image, BMI, depression and anxiety in Chinese college students during the COVID-19 pandemic"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Han, B., Du, G., Yang, Y., Chen, J., & Sun, G. ",["$","i",null,{"children":"BMC Public Health"}],", 23, 24."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"scholarly-note","children":"共同作者；论文署名为 Yashu Yang。"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"article-link","href":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12889-022-14917-9","children":"查看论文 ↗"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"note-tag","children":"CONFERENCE PRESENTATION · 2024"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Reimagining Local Identity through Cicada Nymphs"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"World Anthropological Union Congress · 2024 年 11 月"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"scholarly-note","children":"独立作者会议报告。"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"reading-section","id":"collaborate","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"可以一起做什么"}],"$Ld"]}],"$Le"]]}],"$Lf"]
